{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"何西阿书","commonName":"何西阿书","title":"何西阿书","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"0fd01139d1173aab3c4eae9aadc1f8604860ccbde5e4b3d2c68eec56323410c3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":197},"chapter":{"number":9,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["何西阿宣布对以色列的惩罚"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"以色列啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要欢喜快乐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要像外族人那样欢喜快乐！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你对你的上帝不忠不贞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"喜爱在各麦场上接受嫖资。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"麦场上的谷物和榨酒池的酒将不够养活你们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"新酒也必断绝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们将不能再住在耶和华的土地上。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法莲要返回埃及，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在亚述吃不洁之物。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们将不能再献奠祭给耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的祭牲也不蒙悦纳。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这些祭物如居丧之人的食物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吃的人都被玷污。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的食物只能供自己吃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不能带进耶和华的殿。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在节日，在耶和华所定的节期里，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要做什么呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使你们逃脱毁灭之灾，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"埃及人也要把你们聚集起来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在摩弗埋葬你们。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的珍贵银器要散落在荆棘中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的帐篷中要长满蒺藜。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列人受惩罚的日子近了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"遭报应的时候到了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们必知道。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你们罪恶深重，充满憎恨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"先知被当成傻瓜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被灵感动的人被视为疯子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"先知为了上帝做以法莲的守望者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"可是他走的路上布满网罗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在他上帝的家里遭人憎恨。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们败坏至极，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"恰如从前在基比亚的日子。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华必记住你们的罪恶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"追讨你们的罪债。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“昔日我看见以色列时，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像在荒野看见葡萄；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看见你们的祖先时，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像在无花果树上看见初熟的果子。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但他们却祭拜巴力·毗珥，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把自己献给可耻的偶像，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"变得像他们所爱的偶像一样可憎。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法莲人的荣耀要如鸟飞逝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们将不能受孕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不能怀胎，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不能生育。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们纵然把孩子养大，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也要夺去他们的性命，一个也不留。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我撇弃你们的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们就有祸了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我看见以法莲栽种在草原上，美如泰尔，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法莲却要把儿女交给屠杀者。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"耶和华啊，求你给他们——","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要给他们什么呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你使他们子宫流产，乳房干瘪。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“因他们在吉甲的一切恶行，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我已憎恶他们。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因他们的恶行，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要将他们逐出我的家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不再爱他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的首领都是悖逆之人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法莲要被击打，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的根将枯干，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再也不能结果。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就算他们能生儿育女，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也要杀死他们心爱的孩子。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"我的上帝必弃绝他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们不听从祂。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必在列国中流离飘泊。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/9.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/10.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/8.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}